                <td style="padding: 15px; font-weight: 600; border: 1px solid var(--border);"><strong>Primary Base Stock</strong></td>
                <td style="padding: 15px; border: 1px solid var(--border);">Highly refined mineral oils blended with clean-burning synthetic Polyisobutylene (PIB) and polar esters.</td>
                <td style="padding: 15px; border: 1px solid var(--border);">High thermal stability Group II/III hydrocracked mineral oils, or synthetic Group IV PAO.</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);">
                <td style="padding: 15px; font-weight: 600; border: 1px solid var(--border);"><strong>Detergent Type</strong></td>
                <td style="padding: 15px; border: 1px solid var(--border);">Ashless nitrogen-based dispersants (e.g., Polyisobutylene Succinimide - PIB-SI) for zero metallic ash.</td>
                <td style="padding: 15px; border: 1px solid var(--border);">Overbased metallic detergents (Calcium/Magnesium Sulfonates or Phenates) for high acid neutralization.</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);">
                <td style="padding: 15px; font-weight: 600; border: 1px solid var(--border);"><strong>Anti-Wear Chemistry</strong></td>
                <td style="padding: 15px; border: 1px solid var(--border);">Organic esters and amine-phosphate boundary lubricants to prevent metal contact without ash.</td>
                <td style="padding: 15px; border: 1px solid var(--border);">Zinc Dialkyldithiophosphate (ZDDP) for protective phosphate glass tribofilm formation.</td>
              </tr>
