                <td style="padding: 15px; border: 1px solid var(--border);">Strictly zero solvents to maintain high flash points and prevent premature evaporation.</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);">
                <td style="padding: 15px; font-weight: 600; border: 1px solid var(--border);"><strong>Viscosity Index (VI)</strong></td>
                <td style="padding: 15px; border: 1px solid var(--border);">Typically lower (SAE 20 to SAE 30), as viscosity stability is not a multi-hour requirement.</td>
                <td style="padding: 15px; border: 1px solid var(--border);">High VI (often 150+) maintained via shear-stable polymers for multigrade performance (e.g., 10W-40).</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>

        <!-- COMPARISON INFOGRAPHIC IMAGE -->
